1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,160
Every morning, she drew at the same café.

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:06,330
And every morning, her bag took the other chair.

3
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:09,301
Until someone asked, “Mind if I sit?”

4
00:00:09,601 --> 00:00:11,779
She hesitated... then moved it.

5
00:00:11,779 --> 00:00:13,351
He noticed her sketchbook.

6
00:00:13,351 --> 00:00:15,155
“Wait... you drew this?”

7
00:00:15,155 --> 00:00:17,436
They talked until their coffee went cold.

8
00:00:17,986 --> 00:00:20,551
The next morning, she saved his seat.

9
00:00:21,351 --> 00:00:22,485
Then the next.

10
00:00:22,935 --> 00:00:25,499
By the fourth morning, the bag was back.

11
00:00:26,399 --> 00:00:29,479
That's when she heard, “I tried drawing our table.”

12
00:00:29,479 --> 00:00:30,922
He held up a sketchbook.

13
00:00:30,922 --> 00:00:32,056
Crooked legs.

14
00:00:32,056 --> 00:00:33,422
Cups like potatoes.

15
00:00:33,672 --> 00:00:35,386
She laughed, moved her bag...

16
00:00:35,386 --> 00:00:37,100
and pulled out his chair.
